# Gmail SMTP Configuration for Contact Email Delivery
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on your Google Account (thapaprabhat4@gmail.com)
# 2. Go to Security > 2-Step Verification > App passwords
# 3. Generate a 16-character App Password (e.g. xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx)
# 4. Copy this file to .env.local and add your credentials:
SMTP_EMAIL=thapaprabhat4@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-16-character-gmail-app-password
SMTP_RECEIVER=thapaprabhat4@gmail.com
